-```ts
-(g: Graph) =>
-    g.all("function").nodes()
-      .filter((v) => v.module === "rendering" && closure(v).some((d) => d.node === Prelude))
-      .map((v) => ({ on: v, what: "A renderer reaches the prelude, hence the graph" }))
-```
-
-</details>
